Modified by AdamMady. Standalone revision dated October 23, 2026.
Changes include per-listener voice routing, additional host playback capacity,
live configuration, network update caps, standalone Mod Settings metadata,
optional background voice recompression, and independent 15-100% voice quality sliders.
This is a modified version, not the original Bigger Walk release.

The modified work is distributed under GNU GPL v3.0. Keep the original license
and applicable notices. When conveying binaries, also provide corresponding
source, including modifications and the files needed to build them, through
one of the methods permitted by GPL section 6.

The Bigger Walk directory contains the modified C# source and project file. Build with:
  dotnet build "Bigger Walk/Bigger Walk.csproj" -c Release -p:GameDir="C:\path\to\Big Walk"
Requires .NET 6 SDK and the game's generated BepInEx 6 IL2CPP interop assemblies.
Game assemblies are external references and are not included with this mod.
